# GitHub's language bar counts only languages Linguist types as `programming`
# or `markup`. Markdown is typed `prose`, so it is excluded from every repo's
# stats by default — which here means the bar describes the hooks and wrappers
# and stays silent about the skills, and the skills are half of what ShipShape
# is. Counting them is the accurate picture, not a flattering one.
*.md linguist-detectable=true
